OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start to the day this
OL,6,Fmorning with some brightness. Then
OL,7,Fclouding over with scattered showers
OL,8,Fbreaking out through the afternoon.
OL,9,FLight westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers mostly dying out this
OL,12,Fevening, although a few continuing
OL,13,Fovernight over Galloway. Otherwise a
OL,14,Fdry night with variable amounts of
OL,15,Fcloud and clear periods. Light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FMainly dry with bright or
OL,18,Fsunny spells, just one or two light
OL,19,Fshowers across the Southern Uplands.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
