OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright on Sunday. Cloudy with rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast on Monday,
OL,8,Fbecoming drier on Tuesday in the
OL,9,Fsouthwest.
